#### Transfer more than wealth. Transfer wisdom.

Discretionary management means we act on your behalf within an agreed mandate—so your plan keeps moving, even when markets are noisy. We operate to a fiduciary standard, put your interests first, and document decisions you can review. That lets us rebalance when needed, add or trim exposures, and maintain discipline through volatility.

#### What happens

-   Values & vision
    
-   Roles & readiness
    
-   Decisions & documents
    
-   Continuity plan
    

-   A shared values statement
    
-   Clear roles, decisions, and next steps
    
-   Fewer surprises—and fewer points of conflict—later on
    

#### What you’ll leave with

-   5-minute Financial Values Quiz (pre-work lead magnet)
    
-   Post-meeting recap + 30/90-day follow-ups
    

